  <iati-identifier>47045-COM-T-ASCOBEF-1</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="47045" secondary-reporter="0" type="30">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">End  tuberculosis epidemic in the Union of the Comoros by 2035 - Comoros (01-Oct-2015-30-Sep-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comoros, Tuberculosis, Association Comorienne pour le Bien-E&#x302;tre de la Famille (ASCOBEF)This program has the following goals: To reduce morbidity and TB -related mortality by 2017. The objectives of this program are: Improve the managerial capacities of the NTLP.  Increase the TB case notification rate from 17 cases/100,000 inhabitants in 2012 to 23 cases/100,000 in 2019.  Maintain the treatment success rate for TB patients at &gt; 90&#xa0;percent by focusing on directly observed treatment and decentralizing it to outlying health centers.  Promote operational research in order to base the NTLP&#x2019;s activities on greater evidence.  Provide case management of &gt; 95&#xa0;percent of TB/HIV+ by testing for HIV among more than 95&#xa0;percent of TB patients and screening for TB among all PLHIV, as well as treatment (CPT, ART) for TB/HIV.  Provide MDR-TB case management</narrative>
  </description>
